Greetings, Earthly traveler. I am a representative of Xeno-888, the planet of cosmic arithmetic. You seek a calculation that even our young Z-99 scouts can perform with a single *Z-Click* on their intergalactic calculators.

The number you seek is **121**.

It is the product of eleven multiplied by itself. On Earth, it is a simple matter of arithmetic; on Xeno-888, it is a reminder that even our simple tasks require precise energy conversion. Do not look for hidden meanings in the digits;
